---
layout: layouts/blog-base.njk
title: "Where to See Real Animals Near You"
excerpt: "Find zoos, aquariums, museums and farms near you where your family can see a real lion, hippo, penguin, dinosaur fossil and more. Search by animal, see the closest places on a map."
permalink: /zoos/
ogType: website
jsonld: '{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","name":"Where to see real animals near you","url":"https://wildatlasapp.com/zoos/","description":"Find zoos, aquariums, museums and farms near you where your family can see real animals.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"Wild Atlas","url":"https://wildatlasapp.com/"}}'
---
{% include "zoos-app.njk" %}
<section class="zf-seo zf-directory" aria-labelledby="zf-dir-h">
  <h2 id="zf-dir-h">Browse by Wild Atlas animal</h2>
  <div class="zf-packs">
    {%- for pk in zoodata.packs %}
    <section class="zf-pack" aria-labelledby="zf-pack-{{ pk.id }}">
      <header class="zf-pack-head">
        {%- if pk.img %}<img src="/assets/mascots/{{ pk.img }}.png" alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
        <h3 id="zf-pack-{{ pk.id }}">{{ pk.name }}</h3>
        <span class="zf-pack-n">{{ pk.animals.length }}</span>
      </header>
      <ul class="zf-pack-links">{% for r in pk.animals %}<li><a href="/zoos/{{ r.slug }}/">{{ r.name }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    </section>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
